  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 205.02 Filing. The original and one copy of a petition for rulemaking shall be filed with the board in accordance with We 202.03.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
